  "_about": "Arsound colour themes, from the Claude Design handoff 'Arsound: визуальный стиль' (step 1, five directions); Scarlet is variant 1a of 'Arsound App v2'. \"darkOnly\" themes keep the app dark whatever the phone's mode, their light palette only colours what SoundCloud keeps light on dark screens (the round buttons of the player). \"colors\" overrides any other SoundCloud colour by name; \"resources\" are whole files from overrides/<theme>/<type>/<name>.xml that stand in for SoundCloud's (names starting with arsound_ are the theme's own additions). \"decor\" decorates Arsound's own screens. Colours are #rrggbb or #rrggbbaa. Fonts name the files in fonts/ (tools/branding/theme_fonts.py). Radii in dp. Read by the theme patch (splash screen, fonts) and by the app (ArsoundTheme).",
